                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "This implies that this X_PollRate property already existed.  You're ADDING a per sensor pollrate property.\n\nUpdate this commit message to that effect, then specify WHY you're adding a pollrate per sensor for PWM sensors.  That part isn't clear, doesn't the sensor live on the same bus/pmbus page?  Changing the polling rate of one doesn't seem likely to change any behavior."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "PeterYinGit",
                        "email": "peter.yin@quantatw.com",
