                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "commit message still doesn't call out why adding pollrates for properties that exist on the same pmbus page make sense.  Discussion below seems to have uncovered that these aren't pmbus devices at all, so probably shouldn't have been put in psusensor to begin with.  Ideally that would've been resolved in this comment instead of just marking it done, but oh well, lets make progress."
                }
